  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Readiness 2023: Development of an effective governance framework for MHEWS in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peru builds a solid governance architecture for the implementation of a national MHEWS that facilitates the implementation of the NAP and NDCs&apos; goals, with an emphasis on multi-sector and multi-level, regional and local integration, coordination, articulation, participation, and capacity-building of competent actors at all levels, reducing the vulnerability of rural and urban communities and their livelihoods to climate variability and change.</narrative>
  </description>
